# Ignore everything by default. Only the files listed below are tracked,
# so session transcripts, history, logs and caches can never be committed.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md

# Skills: each published skill must be allowlisted explicitly.
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/changeset/
!skills/changeset/**
!skills/commit-and-push/
!skills/commit-and-push/**
!skills/github-pr/
!skills/github-pr/**
!skills/monitor-main-ci/
!skills/monitor-main-ci/**
!skills/work-on-issue/
!skills/work-on-issue/**
